<title>CHINA: BZW sets warrants on HK's China-affiliated index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on HK's China-affiliated index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Thursday it has launched 550 million American-style call warrants on the Hang Seng China-Affiliated Corporations Index.</p>
<p>Five thousand warrants control one index. One index point equals HK$1.00.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3,231.34  PREMIUM	 24.13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1982    GEARING	 3.43x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 16.JUL.97    LISTING DATE  31.JUL.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  29.JUN.98    PAYDATE	 29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
